flowchart TD
  R[Researcher] --> C[Contract]
  C --> ER[Agent-neutral YAML experiment recipe]
  ER --> G[Goose reference operator]
  ER -.same recipe.-> A[Other validated primary-agent adapters]
  G --> N[Native agent capabilities]
  N --> P[Plan / Todo]
  N --> S[Skills]
  N --> SS[Summon specialist subagents / subrecipes]
  N --> M[MCP / Developer tools]
  G --> H[Mandatory host toolchain]
  H --> GW[LiteLLM + OmniRoute]
  H --> AO[Numbat + Aegis + Phoenix/OpenTelemetry + ClawMetry]
  G --> VM[Disposable Lima/QEMU VM]
  VM --> I[Instrumentation profile]
  I --> W[Recipe-defined workload]
  W --> E[Evidence]
  E --> ST[session.yaml + evidence index]
  E --> AN[Analysis]
  AN --> V[Independent verification]
  V --> RR[Research report]
  RR --> PR[Preserve evidence + provenance]
  PR --> D[Destroy VM]
  G -. optional .-> CU[Container Use]
  RR -. after verified run .-> L[Learning enabled in session.yaml]
  L --> LR[Retrieve → Propose → Execute → Evaluate → Refine → Replay → Verify → Human approval → Promote]
  LR --> SKV[skills/validated]
